{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019yVqrmQBonfXtgVR1WFMs2","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 192795f8bf6fc0799a5d12c297ac5b7e76c0f23a\nAuthor: wenjyue84 <wenjyue@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Apr 14 06:00:13 2026 +0800\n\n    feat: Add Bing Webmaster Tools verification meta tag support\n    \n    - Add NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN environment variable support\n    - Update layout.tsx metadata.verification to include Bing msvalidate.01 token\n    - Support auto-import of GSC verification in Bing Webmaster Tools\n    - Document Bing verification setup in .env.local.example\n    - Sitemap already available at https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/sitemap.xml\n    \n    Story ID: US-081\n    Acceptance criteria met:\n    - [x] Verification meta tag support added to layout.tsx\n    - [x] Environment variable configuration documented\n    - [x] Build passes (79 static pages generated)\n    - [ ] Manual steps: Create Bing account, verify site, submit sitemap (external actions)\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .spiral/_claude_raw_8200.tmp  |   0\n .spiral/_sys_prompt_8200.txt  | 429 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n .spiral/_user_prompt_8200.txt |   1 +\n .spiral/spiral_events.jsonl   |   1 +\n prd.json                      |   8 +-\n progress.txt                  |   3 +\n results.tsv                   |   1 +\n retry-counts.json             |   3 +-\n site/.env.local.example       |  12 ++\n site/src/app/layout.tsx       |   9 +-\n 10 files changed, 462 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)\n[rerun: b54]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d904885-7413-494e-8511-9a02e1f067dc","uuid":"3e0750f8-7b28-4b1f-91ac-a968585dffc0","timestamp":"2026-04-13T22:18:47.070Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit 192795f8bf6fc0799a5d12c297ac5b7e76c0f23a\nAuthor: wenjyue84 <wenjyue@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Apr 14 06:00:13 2026 +0800\n\n    feat: Add Bing Webmaster Tools verification meta tag support\n    \n    - Add NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION_TOKEN environment variable support\n    - Update layout.tsx metadata.verification to include Bing msvalidate.01 token\n    - Support auto-import of GSC verification in Bing Webmaster Tools\n    - Document Bing verification setup in .env.local.example\n    - Sitemap already available at https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/sitemap.xml\n    \n    Story ID: US-081\n    Acceptance criteria met:\n    - [x] Verification meta tag support added to layout.tsx\n    - [x] Environment variable configuration documented\n    - [x] Build passes (79 static pages generated)\n    - [ ] Manual steps: Create Bing account, verify site, submit sitemap (external actions)\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n .spiral/_claude_raw_8200.tmp  |   0\n .spiral/_sys_prompt_8200.txt  | 429 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n .spiral/_user_prompt_8200.txt |   1 +\n .spiral/spiral_events.jsonl   |   1 +\n prd.json                      |   8 +-\n progress.txt                  |   3 +\n results.tsv                   |   1 +\n retry-counts.json             |   3 +-\n site/.env.local.example       |  12 ++\n site/src/app/layout.tsx       |   9 +-\n 10 files changed, 462 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01WnXLERgP1VmZRNU68PudFv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"In the Bing meta tag story, prd.json only had 8 lines changed (`8 +-`), not 3150. So each SPIRAL iteration's Ralph agent does a focused commit with prd.json having minimal changes.\n\nThe current situation shows prd.json has 3150 lines staged - this is unusual. This is likely because the SPIRAL auto-stash system has accumulated multiple prd.json updates that weren't committed in between, or the prd.json was modified by something between iterations.\n\nLooking at the stash: `spiral-auto-stash-iter-16` only contains prd.json. \n\nThe `_prd_prestash_16.json` shows US-171 as passes=false, but the current staging has US-171 as passes=true along with many other changes. So at iteration start, the SPIRAL system auto-stashed the accumulated prd.json changes into the stash, then restored the working tree for Ralph to work with. But if the stash only contains prd.json and the working tree was cleaned, I'm confused about where all these current changes came from.\n\nLooking at the stash details, it shows 822 deletions in prd.json, but the staged state has a 3150-line diff—these don't match. The stash was created at the start of iteration 16 to preserve the state before Ralph began, but it was never applied. So the staged changes must be separate from what's in the stash, either already staged before the stash was created or added afterward.\n\nNow I'm realizing I need to focus on what SPIRAL actually expects: the staged prd.json has 3150 lines of diff, which exceeds the SPIRAL_MAX_DIFF_LINES limit of 2000. The question is whether SPIRAL counts only the changes Ralph makes in this iteration or the entire accumulated staged state. I should check the checkpoint file or test report to understand how the diff guard actually works, since if it's counting the pre-existing staged state, that would already be over the limit before Ralph even starts.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":954,"cache_read_input_tokens":62136,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":954},"output_tokens":35,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d904885-7413-494e-8511-9a02e1f067dc","uuid":"612f7051-e170-401e-824a-dad83579555c"}
